Multiple Exception
-------------------
- Some time we have more than one exception in our program.
- So we have to write multiple except block.

try:
    a = int(input("Enter any num: "))
    b = int(input("Enter ant num: "))
    c=a//b
    print(c)
except ValueError as e:
    print(f"The value is not integer type ")
    print(e)
except ZeroDivisionError as e   :
    print(f"B value is zero ")
    print(e)
finally:
    print("Thank you")

